  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed bedrooms within the loft would provide inadequate floor-to-ceiling heights, resulting in cramped and poor-quality accommodation for future occupiers. Furthermore, one of the bedrooms would be served solely by rooflights, providing no outlook. In addition, whilst a large kitchen/diner is proposed, the absence of any dedicated communal living space would result in an inadequate level of shared amenity for an 8-person HMO. Taken together, the scheme fails to provide an acceptable standard of living for future occupiers, contrary to Policies DMD 5 (Residential conversions) and DMD 8 (Houses in Multiple Occupation) of Enfield's Development Management Document (2014), Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021) and Chapter 12 of the NPPF (2024)."
  ],
